{"world_id":"f0d24d96-1f22-458a-b72d-886eedbb9966","entries":[{"sequence":1,"event_id":"f79a52ca-717e-4187-bfd9-f3e571cef268","event_type":"world_seeded","title":"world_seeded","text":null,"participant_ids":[],"location_id":null,"scene_id":null,"absolute_index":0,"revision":0},{"sequence":2,"event_id":"f6815e57-3729-4b1b-8b6e-a354602b1791","event_type":"world_ticked","title":"world_ticked","text":null,"participant_ids":[],"location_id":null,"scene_id":null,"absolute_index":1,"revision":0},{"sequence":3,"event_id":"685a546e-5082-4173-b5f3-9b5b6ea7d4a7","event_type":"action_resolved","title":"At Hearth, the morning light crept across the ground as Wren looked toward the stranger's broken cart, a silent question","text":"At Hearth, the morning light crept across the ground as Wren looked toward the stranger's broken cart, a silent question hanging in the air about whether they ought to offer help. Ash took in the scene carefully, studying the broken cart and the stranger beside it with a watchful eye. \"A broken cart before breakfast — could be a good deed or a trap. Let's go see, but keep your wits about you.\"","participant_ids":["2b3fd962-e609-4133-9ebb-916cccde6da7","c91aafa5-c9be-4a4a-a0a6-c5904b0f0f8a"],"location_id":"43540751-15cb-4961-885b-bd635dca57f8","scene_id":"c16a99a9-e68f-5281-acd1-6921e4277fbd","absolute_index":1,"revision":0},{"sequence":4,"event_id":"c76a2637-979b-4a61-a3ff-f322ccacbd75","event_type":"world_ticked","title":"world_ticked","text":null,"participant_ids":[],"location_id":null,"scene_id":null,"absolute_index":2,"revision":0},{"sequence":5,"event_id":"243e34e0-e857-4d76-b83b-285e8385c303","event_type":"action_resolved","title":"At Hearth, the two conversations wind together until Ash heads off toward the Market, leaving Old Man Bramble and Wren t","text":"At Hearth, the two conversations wind together until Ash heads off toward the Market, leaving Old Man Bramble and Wren to watch over the broken cart.","participant_ids":["2b3fd962-e609-4133-9ebb-916cccde6da7","42f185f5-505f-51b9-b1a1-d6089a5a0ac2","c91aafa5-c9be-4a4a-a0a6-c5904b0f0f8a"],"location_id":"43540751-15cb-4961-885b-bd635dca57f8","scene_id":"47798bc3-e36d-501c-9975-3fbb0867274a","absolute_index":2,"revision":0},{"sequence":6,"event_id":"389aaa41-7b22-4a9b-9a05-b49e2cf57215","event_type":"world_ticked","title":"world_ticked","text":null,"participant_ids":[],"location_id":null,"scene_id":null,"absolute_index":3,"revision":0},{"sequence":7,"event_id":"63cbeb35-92f9-438f-bd95-e203992f8e6c","event_type":"action_resolved","title":"At the Hearth, Old Man Bramble turns to Wren, gesturing that he's ready to go—he'll fetch the wheelwright and be quick.","text":"At the Hearth, Old Man Bramble turns to Wren, gesturing that he's ready to go—he'll fetch the wheelwright and be quick. Wren waits, staying put as promised. \"Go on, I'll keep an eye on the cart. We'll be right here when you get back.\"","participant_ids":["42f185f5-505f-51b9-b1a1-d6089a5a0ac2","c91aafa5-c9be-4a4a-a0a6-c5904b0f0f8a"],"location_id":"43540751-15cb-4961-885b-bd635dca57f8","scene_id":"43656f83-86c0-59e4-9cba-98fb0fe36427","absolute_index":3,"revision":0},{"sequence":8,"event_id":"14cbcea1-1b85-4854-b71d-34c057b9c275","event_type":"action_resolved","title":"At the bustling Market, where the calls of vendors and the shuffle of shoppers filled the air, Ash stood still, an islan","text":"At the bustling Market, where the calls of vendors and the shuffle of shoppers filled the air, Ash stood still, an island of patience in the flow of the crowd. They waited, eyes scanning the stalls and lanes for someone or something unseen.","participant_ids":["2b3fd962-e609-4133-9ebb-916cccde6da7"],"location_id":"2148d3fa-b36e-40ba-b1d6-44b6f0477e65","scene_id":"7f4d8f74-5146-5a9a-85c4-9a143ed29b19","absolute_index":3,"revision":0},{"sequence":9,"event_id":"e4d3abbf-7d27-446c-9153-03b763551017","event_type":"world_ticked","title":"world_ticked","text":null,"participant_ids":[],"location_id":null,"scene_id":null,"absolute_index":4,"revision":0},{"sequence":10,"event_id":"05b415e2-c602-4379-a10e-4ec10d74a23c","event_type":"action_resolved","title":"At the Market, Old Man Bramble turns to Wren with a nod, saying he's off to fetch the wheelwright and asking Wren to kee","text":"At the Market, Old Man Bramble turns to Wren with a nod, saying he's off to fetch the wheelwright and asking Wren to keep an eye on the cart until he returns. Wren nods firmly and replies, \"Go on then, Old Man Bramble. I'll keep watch till you're back with the wheelwright — no one'll touch that cart while I'm here.\" Old Man Bramble chuckles softly and says, \"Good, good. Keep your eyes peeled — I'll be back before the sun turns. If anyone comes sniffing around the turnips, give a shout.\" Wren settles in to wait, keeping a watchful eye on the cart as promised. Ash makes his way to Hearth, leaving the Market behind. Wren spots Ash returning and calls out, \"Back already? What word from the wheelwright?\"","participant_ids":["2b3fd962-e609-4133-9ebb-916cccde6da7","42f185f5-505f-51b9-b1a1-d6089a5a0ac2","c91aafa5-c9be-4a4a-a0a6-c5904b0f0f8a"],"location_id":"2148d3fa-b36e-40ba-b1d6-44b6f0477e65","scene_id":"ab7a6172-1bb5-5f7a-b891-2fbe7f0ecc98","absolute_index":4,"revision":0},{"sequence":11,"event_id":"7358aabc-b0ea-450f-bcc5-febc6c5945bc","event_type":"world_ticked","title":"world_ticked","text":null,"participant_ids":[],"location_id":null,"scene_id":null,"absolute_index":5,"revision":0},{"sequence":12,"event_id":"c8875140-ef4f-42bf-98a5-8f50d1ff8cd2","event_type":"action_resolved","title":"Ash waits","text":"Ash waits","participant_ids":["2b3fd962-e609-4133-9ebb-916cccde6da7"],"location_id":"43540751-15cb-4961-885b-bd635dca57f8","scene_id":"be25285e-253c-5527-8f54-997c119d0857","absolute_index":5,"revision":0},{"sequence":13,"event_id":"2d0776fa-9f82-444c-a702-8e22d3cc76c5","event_type":"action_resolved","title":"Old Man Bramble waits","text":"Old Man Bramble waits","participant_ids":["42f185